\texttt{entropy\_max}  & Ref.\ NLL & Maximum token surprise \\
\texttt{entropy\_min}  & Ref.\ NLL & Minimum token surprise \\
\texttt{tail\_decay}   & Ref.\ NLL & Log-prob decay slope (ranks 100--1K) \\
